// @name: Mercury intro
// @tagline: declarative patterns from Amsterdam
// @description: One self-contained `.bps`: a single Mercury voice playing a two-synth pattern → audio. Mercury is a readable, Tone.js-based live-coding language (Timo Hoogland). Put the cursor in the session and Ctrl+Enter to evaluate; Ctrl+. to silence.
// @language: mercury
// @outputs: audio
// @level: didactic
// @tags: mercury
//
// Mercury intro (migré de mercury-intro.kanopi).
// Une voix de code Mercury → audio. Mercury est un langage déclaratif et
// lisible (Timo Hoogland), bâti sur Tone.js. Évaluer la voix `patch` ; Ctrl+.

@actor patch  transport:audio  eval.mercury

S -> patch

patch -> `set tempo 110
set scale minor

new synth saw time(1/8) note(0 0) shape(1 1/16 0.5) gain(0.5)
new synth square time(1/4) note(-7 0) shape(1 1/8 0.4) gain(0.4)`
